<title>POLAND: MOSTOSTAL-Z EXTENDS GOBAIN DEAL.</title>
<headline>MOSTOSTAL-Z EXTENDS GOBAIN DEAL.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1996-10-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Polish construction company Mostostal Zabrze SA signed supplement deals worth 1.6 million zlotys with the Polish unit of Saint Gobain extending the value of the overall deal to 52.8 million zlotys, the firm said.</p>
<p>Mostostal is building a glass factory for Saint Gobain.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
